[2026-09-12 15:40:24] [INFO]   nemotron-3-nano-30b-a3b    refused +0.300 vs complied +0.050 (gap +0.251); AUC 0.760 vs 0.569  -> SEPARATES — not a marker detector
[2026-09-12 15:40:24] [INFO] 
